{"id": "22588", "title": "鬼谷子", "author": "不详", "category": "文学名著", "count": 15, "available": 12, "cover": "files/article/image/22/22588/22588s.jpg", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/22/22588.htm", "intro": "鬼谷子，姓王名诩，卫国（今河南鹤壁市淇县）人。常入云梦山（在河南鹤壁市淇县境内）采药修道。因隐居清溪之鬼谷，故自称鬼谷子。\r\n　　鬼谷子为纵横家之鼻祖，苏秦与张仪为其最杰出的两个弟子〔见《战国策》〕。另有孙膑与庞涓亦为其弟子之说〔见《孙庞演义》〕。", "base": "files/article/html/22/22588", "chapters": [{"title": "捭阖第一", "file": "1657058.html", "available": false}, {"title": "反应第二", "file": "1657059.html", "available": false}, {"title": "内揵第三", "file": "1657060.html", "available": false}, {"title": "抵巇第四", "file": "1657061.html", "available": true}, {"title": "飞箝第五", "file": "1657062.html", "available": true}, {"title": "忤合第六", "file": "1657063.html", "available": true}, {"title": "揣篇第七", "file": "1657064.html", "available": true}, {"title": "摩篇第八", "file": "1657065.html", "available": true}, {"title": "权篇第九", "file": "1657066.html", "available": true}, {"title": "谋篇第十", "file": "1657067.html", "available": true}, {"title": "决篇第十一", "file": "1657068.html", "available": true}, {"title": "符言第十二", "file": "1657069.html", "available": true}, {"title": "转丸第十三（亡佚）", "file": "1657070.html", "available": true}, {"title": "胠乱第十四（亡佚）", "file": "1657071.html", "available": true}, {"title": "本经阴符七篇", "file": "1657072.html", "available": true}]}